<title>BELGIUM: EXCEPTIONALS HIT BELGIAN AVH H1 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>EXCEPTIONALS HIT BELGIAN AVH H1 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1996 earnings</p>
<p>(in million of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net (excludes minorities)   630.8  vs 802.5</p>
<p>    Cons current			    617.3  vs 540.1</p>
<p>    Cons exceptional result		13.5  vs 262.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian holding company Ackermans &amp; Van Haaren NV</p>
<p>(AVH) said a group restructuring involving its Belcofi</p>
<p>affiliate led to an exceptional gain of about 1.39</p>
<p>billion francs. The deconsolidation of its stake in Canadian</p>
<p>Consumers Distributing had a negative effect of 1.37 billion.</p>
<p>The group reiterated its 1996 group net should at least</p>
<p>equal the 1995 earnings.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
